<title>JAPAN: Petronas launches 2.15% samurai due 2003 -- Daiwa.</title>
<headline>Petronas launches 2.15% samurai due 2003 -- Daiwa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead-manager Daiwa Securities on Friday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Petroliam Nasional (Petronas)</p>
<p> AMT		 11 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    2.15 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  22 Jan 2003</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 99.95 yen</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  12 March 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	March 10</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JBRI AA</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    N/A</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
